[bridge] Engine bridge running on http://localhost:3001
[bridge] POST http://localhost:3001/api/engine/start  → start engine
[bridge] POST http://localhost:3001/api/engine/stop   → stop engine
[bridge] GET  http://localhost:3001/api/engine/status → check status
[bridge] POST http://localhost:3001/api/git/status  → git status
[bridge] POST http://localhost:3001/api/git/diff    → git diff
[bridge] POST http://localhost:3001/api/git/commit  → git commit
